{"data": {"Zeri": {"allytips": [], "blurb": "A headstrong, spirited young woman from Zaun's working-class, Zeri channels her electric magic to charge herself and her custom-crafted gun. Her volatile power mirrors her emotions, its sparks reflecting her lightning-fast approach to life. Deeply...", "enemytips": [], "id": "Zeri", "image": {"full": "Zeri.png", "group": "champion", "h": 48, "sprite": "champion5.png", "w": 48, "x": 384, "y": 48}, "info": {"attack": 8, "defense": 5, "difficulty": 6, "magic": 3}, "key": "221", "lore": "A headstrong, spirited young woman from Zaun's working-class, Zeri channels her electric magic to charge herself and her custom-crafted gun. Her volatile power mirrors her emotions, its sparks reflecting her lightning-fast approach to life. Deeply compassionate toward others, Zeri carries the love of her family and her home into every fight. Though her eagerness to help can sometimes backfire, Zeri believes one truth to be certain: stand up for your community, and it will stand up with you.", "name": "Zeri", "partype": "Mana", "passive": {"description": "Zeri's Attacks deal magic damage and are treated as Abilities. Moving and casting Burst Fire stores up energy in Zeri's Sparkpack. When fully charged her next Attack deals bonus damage.", "image": {"full": "ZeriP.png", "group": "passive", "h": 48, "sprite": "passive5.png", "w": 48, "x": 384, "y": 48}, "name": "Living Battery"}, "recommended": [], "skins": [{"chromas": false, "id": "221000", "name": "default", "num": 0}, {"chromas": true, "id": "221001", "name": "Withered Rose Zeri", "num": 1}, {"chromas": false, "id": "221002", "name": "Withered Rose Zeri (Ruby)", "num": 2, "parentSkin": 1}, {"chromas": false, "id": "221003", "name": "Withered Rose Zeri (Citrine)", "num": 3, "parentSkin": 1}, {"chromas": false, "id": "221004", "name": "Withered Rose Zeri (Peridot)", "num": 4, "parentSkin": 1}, {"chromas": false, "id": "221005", "name": "Withered Rose Zeri (Sapphire)", "num": 5, "parentSkin": 